{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 180777, "name": "Oleksandr Chernetskii", "username": "sparcher", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/sparcher/{size}/15345_2.png", "created_at": "2019-10-30T22:30:55.237Z", "cooked": "<h2><a name=\"p-180777-cant-found-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-180777-cant-found-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Can’t found cherrytree package in Fedora 31.</h2>\n<pre><code> dnf search cherrytree\nLast metadata expiration check: 0:37:01 ago on Wed Oct 30 23:06:16 2019.\nNo matches found.\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<pre><code>dnf repolist\nLast metadata expiration check: 1:15:48 ago on Wed Oct 30 23:11:29 2019.\nrepo id                                                               repo name                                                         status\ncopr:copr.fedorainfracloud.org:bgstack15:palemoon                     Copr repo for palemoon owned by bgstack15                             4\n*fedora                                                               Fedora 31 - x86_64                                                56251\n*fedora-modular                                                       Fedora Modular 31 - x86_64                                          142\ngoogle-chrome                                                         google-chrome                                                         3\n*rpmfusion-free                                                       RPM Fusion for Fedora 31 - Free                                     588\n*rpmfusion-free-updates                                               RPM Fusion for Fedora 31 - Free - Updates                            10\n*rpmfusion-nonfree                                                    RPM Fusion for Fedora 31 - Nonfree                                  218\n*rpmfusion-nonfree-updates                                            RPM Fusion for Fedora 31 - Nonfree - Updates                          4\n*updates                                                              Fedora 31 - x86_64 - Updates                                       2362\n*updates-modular                                                      Fedora Modular 31 - x86_64 - Updates                                141\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p>Fedora 30 have cherrytree<br>\n<a href=\"https://archive.fedoraproject.org/pub/archive/fedora/linux/releases/30/Everything/x86_64/os/Packages/c/cherrytree-0.38.5-5.fc30.noarch.rpm\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://archive.fedoraproject.org/pub/archive/fedora/linux/releases/30/Everything/x86_64/os/Packages/c/cherrytree-0.38.5-5.fc30.noarch.rpm</a></p>\n<p>What’s going on?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T20:55:36.258Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1969, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 9849.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 76840, "topic_slug": "where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31", "display_username": "Oleksandr Chernetskii", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://archive.fedoraproject.org/pub/archive/fedora/linux/releases/30/Everything/x86_64/os/Packages/c/cherrytree-0.38.5-5.fc30.noarch.rpm", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 41}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9534, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31/76840/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 175206, "name": "Oscar Torrente", "username": "q2dg", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/q/3c6eb4/{size}.png", "created_at": "2019-10-31T00:03:51.014Z", "cooked": "<p>It seems so:<br>\n<a href=\"https://apps.fedoraproject.org/packages/cherrytree/builds/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://apps.fedoraproject.org/packages/cherrytree/builds/</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://koji.fedoraproject.org/koji/taskinfo?taskID=36632360\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://koji.fedoraproject.org/koji/taskinfo?taskID=36632360</a></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:52:52.761Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 9, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 49.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 76840, "topic_slug": "where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31", "display_username": "Oscar Torrente", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://apps.fedoraproject.org/packages/cherrytree/builds/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Package cherrytree", "clicks": 75}, {"url": "https://koji.fedoraproject.org/koji/taskinfo?taskID=36632360", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 21}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9045, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31/76840/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 114779, "name": "Elliott Sales de Andrade", "username": "qulogic", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/qulogic/{size}/458_2.png", "created_at": "2019-10-31T00:16:43.168Z", "cooked": "<p>It started to fail to install, and the maintainer seemingly disappeared (I don’t see any updates in over a year) without fixing it, so it was retired: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1737224\" class=\"inline-onebox\">1737224 – cherrytree requires python-appindicator instead of python2-appindicator</a></p>\n<p>If you are really interested in it, then perhaps you could have a go at unretiring and maintaining it. <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Orphaned_package_that_need_new_maintainers#Claiming_Ownership_of_a_Retired_Package\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Orphaned package that need new maintainers - Fedora Project Wiki</a></p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2019-10-31T00:16:43.168Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 27, "reads": 22, "readers_count": 21, "score": 199.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 76840, "topic_slug": "where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31", "display_username": "Elliott Sales de Andrade", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1737224", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "1737224 – cherrytree requires python-appindicator instead of python2-appindicator", "clicks": 28}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Orphaned_package_that_need_new_maintainers#Claiming_Ownership_of_a_Retired_Package", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Orphaned package that need new maintainers - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 21}], "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 487, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31/76840/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 132702, "name": "aescicada", "username": "aescicada", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/aescicada/{size}/15250_2.png", "created_at": "2019-11-15T16:35:24.023Z", "cooked": "<p>To install, enable this COPR repo: <code>sudo dnf copr enable bcotton/cherrytree</code></p>\n<p>Then install cherrytree: <code>sudo dnf install cherrytree</code></p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:36:27.457Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 10, "reads": 18, "readers_count": 17, "score": 53.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 76840, "topic_slug": "where-is-cherrytree-package-in-fedora-31", "display_username": "aescicada", "primary_group_name": null, 